      "description": "Open Science at ITC (OS@ITC) is a horizontal facility of the Faculty of Geo-Information Science and Earth Observation (ITC) at the University of Twente, supporting all ITC departments in adopting Open Science practices. In 2021, it offered CODECHECK as a service to ITC researchers, with checks conducted by the faculty's Open Science Officer before or after submission of a manuscript. Certificates are published in the Open Science at ITC community on Zenodo.",
